re">to access these materials and vote online. We expect to mail this notice and our proxy materials on or </span></div><div style="line-height:8pt;position:var(--position);top:32.55pt;width:379.5pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:2.63pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">about March 12, 2026.</span></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style="height:3pt"><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #003a5d;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #003a5d;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #003a5d;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/></tr><tr style="height:3pt"><td style="border-top:1pt solid #003a5d;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="border-top:1pt solid #003a5d;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="border-top:1pt solid #003a5d;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div style="background-color:transparent;height:53.25pt;left:341.25pt;opacity:1;position:var(--position);top:570.28pt;width:173.85pt;z-index:1"><div><div><div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:7.2pt;width:173.85pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:7.2pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">By Order of the Board of Directors,</span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:23pt;width:173.85pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:7.2pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">James S. Hayes, Corporate Secretary </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:33.8pt;width:173.85pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-s