rm benefit of our </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:262.45pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">stockholders. We regularly review and consider our corporate governance policies and practices, taking into account the U.S. </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:273.25pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">Securities and Exchange Commission&#8217;s (the &#8220;SEC&#8221;) corporate governance rules and regulations, the corporate governance </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:284.05pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">standards of the New York Stock Exchange (the &#8220;NYSE&#8221;) and stockholder feedback. </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:304.85pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">We have adopted the JELD-WEN Holding, Inc. Board Guidelines on Corporate Governance Matters (the &#8220;Corporate </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:315.65pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">Governance Guidelines&#8221;), which provide a framework for the governance of the Company as a whole and describe the </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:326.45pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">principles and practices that the Board follows in carrying out its responsibilities. Our Corporate Governance Guidelines </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:337.25pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">address, among other things: </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:358.05pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">&#8226;</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:63pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">The composition, structure and policies of the Board and its committees; </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:368.85pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">&#8226;</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:63pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">Director qualification standards; </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:379.65pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space