executives</span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);top:33.6pt;width:145.5pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:28.24pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">on the Company's ESG progress.</span></div></div></div></div></div><div style="background-color:transparent;height:48.38pt;left:300.75pt;opacity:1;position:var(--position);top:497.6pt;width:145.5pt;z-index:5"><div><div><div><div style="line-height:8pt;position:var(--position);top:7.2pt;width:145.5pt"><span style="font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;left:8.59pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">THE ESG STEERING COMMITTEE</span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);top:16.8pt;width:145.5pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:21.99pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">The ESG steering committee supports</span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);top:26.4pt;width:145.5pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:21.59pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">the company's ongoing commitment to</span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);top:33.6pt;width:145.5pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:13.34pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">ESG matters and ensures alignment with the</span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);top:40.8pt;width:145.5pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:33.11pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-sp