color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:16.13pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">Financial Experience</span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:356.92pt;width:104.25pt"><span style="color:#1d446b;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:2.629999999999999pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">&#9632;</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:16.13pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">Global Experience </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:369.82pt;width:104.25pt"><span style="color:#1d446b;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:2.629999999999999pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">&#9632;</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:16.13pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">IT / Cybersecurity</span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:382.72pt;width:104.25pt"><span style="color:#1d446b;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:2.629999999999999pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">&#9632;</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:16.13pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">Compliance </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:392.62pt;width:104.25pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:16.13pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">