top:4.46pt;width:77.25pt"><span style="color:#d6d7d8;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;left:4.07pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">ANNUAL</span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:15.26pt;width:77.25pt"><span style="color:#d6d7d8;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;left:4.07pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">MEETING AND</span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:26.06pt;width:77.25pt"><span style="color:#d6d7d8;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;left:4.07pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">VOTING INFO</span></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style="height:3pt"><td style="font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="background-color:#00a1df;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:108pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">salary adjustments, the Committee considers numerous factors, including the NEO&#8217;s performance, our financial results, the </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:118.8pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">relative significance of the NEO&#8217;s business unit or function, the NEO&#8217;s past performance and potential for advancement, and </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:129.6pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">comparable salaries paid to other executive officers with similar skills and experience in our peer group or industry. </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:150.4pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">The following table shows the 2025 annual base salary amounts for each of our NEOs: </span></div><div style="position:var(--position);top:171.2pt;width:594pt"><div style="font-size:0pt;left:45pt;position:var(--position);width:504pt"><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="height:0"><td style="padding:0;width:9.75pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:384.75pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:99.75pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:9.75pt"/></tr><tr style="height:9.75pt"><td style="background-color:#e5f5fb;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="background-color:#e5f5fb;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="background-color:#e5f5fb;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="background-color:#e5f5fb;font-size:0;text-alig