formance compensation program and how the Company aligns executive compensation with </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:176.8pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">performance, refer to the CD&amp;A. </span></div><div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:12pt;position:var(--position);top:199.6pt;width:594pt"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="ecd:PvpTableTextBlock" id="f-6" continuedAt="f-6-1" escape="true"><span style="color:#00a1df;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">Pay Versus Performance Table</span></ix:nonNumeric></div><ix:continuation id="f-6-1"><div style="position:var(--position);top:222pt;width:594pt"><div style="font-size:0pt;left:45pt;position:var(--position);width:504pt"><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="height:0"><td style="padding:0;width:3pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:21pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:45pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:44.25pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:45pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:44.25pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:45pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:44.25pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:45pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:42.75pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:27.75pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:30.75pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:30.75pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:32.25pt"/><td style="padding:0;width:3pt"/></tr><tr style="height:9.75pt"><td style="background-color:#e5f5fb;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="background-color:#e5f5fb;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="background-color:#e5f5fb;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"/><td style="background-color:#e5f5fb;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertic