hite-space:pre">What votes need to be present to hold the Annual Meeting? </span></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:592.8pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">Under our Bylaws, a quorum will exist at the Annual Meeting if stockholders holding a majority of the shares entitled to vote at </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:603.6pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">the Annual Meeting are present in person or by proxy. Stockholders of record who return a proxy or vote in person at the </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:614.4pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">meeting will be considered part of the quorum. </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:635.2pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">Abstentions, withheld votes and broker non-votes are counted as &#8220;present&#8221; for determining a quorum. Virtual attendance at our </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);top:646pt;width:594pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre">Annual Meeting constitutes presence in person for purposes of quoru