> </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:640.2pt;width:594pt"><span style="font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:117pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:8.48pt">(f)</span><span style="font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:153pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:395.94pt">Notwithstanding the foregoing provisions of Section 4.3, the following Shares may not again be</span><span style="font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:548.94pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.5pt"> </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:651pt;width:594pt"><span style="font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:81pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:467.92pt">made available for issuance as Awards under the Plan:&#160; (i) Shares withheld from an Award or delivered by a</span><span style="font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:548.9200000000001pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.5pt"> </span></div><div style="line-height:9pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:661.8pt;width:594pt"><span style="font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:81pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:467.96pt">Participant to satisfy tax withholding requirements for an Award; (ii) Shares not issued or delivered as a result of the</span><span style="font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:5