style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:251.60999999999999pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:1.66pt"> </span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:37.55pt;width:254.25pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:2.63pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:248.86pt">Eastern Time on April 16, 2026 for shares held in a Plan. Have your proxy card in hand when</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:251.49pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:1.66pt"> </span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:44.75pt;width:254.25pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:2.63pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:248.86pt">you access the web site and follow the instructions to obtain your records and to create an</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:251.49pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:1.66pt"> </span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:51.95pt;width:254.25pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:2.63pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:87.51pt">electronic voting instruction form.</span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:64.15pt;width:254.25pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;left:2.63pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:52.58pt">During The Meeting</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:55.21pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:21.61pt"> - Go to </span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;left:76.82pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre;width:135.12pt">www.virtualshareholdermeeting.com/JELD2026</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:211.94pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:1.66pt"> </span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:76.35pt;width:254.25pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:2.63pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:248.98pt">You may attend the meeting via the Internet and vote during the meeting. Have the</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:251.60999999999999pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:1.66pt"> </span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:83.55pt;width:254.25pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:2.63pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:248.56pt">information that is printed in the box marked by the arrow available and follow the instructions.</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:251.19pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:1.66pt"> </span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:95.75pt;width:254.25pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;left:2.63pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:97.2pt">VOTE BY PHONE - 1-800-690-6903</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;left:99.83pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:1.66pt"> </span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:102.95pt;width:254.25pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:2.63pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:248.92pt">Use any touch-tone telephone to transmit your voting instructions up until 11:59 p.m. Eastern</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:251.54999999999998pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:1.56pt"> </span></div><div style="line-height:6pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:110.15pt;width:254.25pt"><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:2.63pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:248.96pt">Time on April 21, 2026 for shares held directly and by 11:59 p.m. Eastern Time on April 16,</span><span style="color:#191919;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:251.59pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:1